            "notes": "New build includes [Blitz Barrage](item_b6bd0c8f-9bd2-4d3d-a353-1e70f74e131b) and [Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) \n\nIf you are surviving with Blitz get [Carpet Bomb](item_3c2ba051-0447-4a1c-8e07-8948136dff94)\n\nWhatever you don't get get it in round 5/7.\n\nFocus here is delete the backline or delete the tank if they have [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) or [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0)\n\nIf you are getting shot out of the sky play better, or get defense based upon what is happening, where the damage is coming from. \n  [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51)  for the additional [Ability Lifesteal](stat_ability_lifesteal)\n\nGetting [Forward Shielding](item_d4e14a06-cff6-47f6-aba7-c9df420588f3)here is a must. If you have extra money go things with health or ap",
