            "notes": "A slight modification to the build after some testing. \n\nCombo is sneak, right click kill someone, potentially die. Repeat. Prioritize close kills as you can ensure that your mini rockets kill someone. eventually you will have your ult, and then you go for larger picks. \n\nI added [R\u00fcstung von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) as an item as it makes you tankier and makes your barrage boost your hp to around 500+\n\nAt this point in the game if you are super ahead  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) with  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) will allow you to do significant damage and grants you a lot of survivability. If you are behind at this point use  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) to help mitigate the attack damage.",
